.vscode
.vs
build
build-*/
# Benchmark data (roadmap 67) defaults to <build>/benchmarks/data, covered by the
# build rules above. The eight root-level names are kept only as a legacy /
# PJH_JSON_BENCH_DATA_DIR-override safety net; they mirror benchmark_test.cpp's
# sizes table and benchmarks/CMakeLists.txt's legacy cleanup list. Every other
# *.json (fixtures, etc.) must stay trackable.
/1mb.json
/10mb.json
/30mb.json
/50mb.json
/100mb.json
/200mb.json
/500mb.json
/1gb.json
# libFuzzer crash/leak/timeout artifacts (default written to CWD by hand runs)
fuzz/crash-*
fuzz/leak-*
fuzz/timeout-*
fuzz/oom-*
fuzz/slow-unit-*
